@startuml
title CMTAT Lifecycle — Pause and Deactivation
hide empty description
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Active

Active  -right-> Paused : pause()\n[PAUSER_ROLE]
Paused  -left->  Active : unpause()\n[PAUSER_ROLE]
Paused  -down->  Deactivated : deactivateContract()\n[DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE]\n(must be paused)

Active : Blocked by pause: transfer / transferFrom /\napprove / permit / crosschainMint / crosschainBurn /\nburnFrom / self-burn
Active : Still available: issuer mint / burn, freeze,\nforcedTransfer / forcedBurn

Deactivated : terminal, deactivated() == true
Deactivated : unpause() reverts\n(CMTAT_PauseModule_ContractIsDeactivated)
Deactivated : Blocked additionally: mint / burn\n(EnforcedDeactivation)
Deactivated : Still available: forcedTransfer / forcedBurn, freeze

note bottom of Deactivated
  Irreversible: no function clears the flag
  (only a proxy upgrade could).
  Invariant: deactivated implies paused.
end note

Deactivated --> [*]
@enduml
